nimchoo carries a list of the world's towns and cities, used to say where an activity
started (`nch list -v`).  It is derived from GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org), the
"cities5000" file, which is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).  The list is src/nimchoo/places/cities.tsv.gz
(name, country, latitude, longitude, population); tools/makecities.nim makes it.

Map tiles shown by `nch heatmap --web` are loaded by the browser from OpenStreetMap
(c) OpenStreetMap contributors, and Leaflet (BSD 2-Clause) from unpkg.com.
